      "message": "docs: retire ROADMAP.md - the open GitHub issues are the roadmap\n\nROADMAP.md was a frozen archive since the Issue Law (2026-11-07). It is\ndeleted from the tree and lives on in git history and every tag up to\nv0.14.0 (git show v0.14.0:ROADMAP.md), as DONE.md did before it.\n\nLive references repointed: AGENTS.md (Issue Law), README.md (Project\ndocuments), and the egui-stack notes in assets/ui/LICENSES.md and\nCargo.toml (now docs/spike-egui-go-no-go.md). History files and source\nprovenance comments are left as they are.\n\nAudit: every item the file still marked owed/partial/not started has an\nissue, so none was filed:\n- Adaptive trochoidal / constant-load (M2.1, M2.4, M8.1, M11.4 C):\n  #5 #6 #44 #47 #220; island late returns #7\n- M11.4 / M11.3 / M11.2 leftovers: #8-#12, #14-#18 (closed), #48\n- M5.2 / M13.5 C-axis live tooling #33; G76 #34 (closed)\n- M7.1 / M7.2 / M13.1 stock engine: #19-#25; M7.3 dexel retirement #26\n- M12.1 Solidcore (and the M1.3 IGES/B-rep deferral) #27\n- M13.3 builds: #28 (closed) #29 #30 #31 #32\n- M13.6 pocket/slot recognition #35\n- M13.9 scallop: #36 #37 #46 (closed) #212\n- M13.11: #13 #38 #40 (closed) #39\nDecision: docs/decisions/41-retire-roadmap.md.\n\nRefs #41\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
